initialize-tmpdir-before-process-startup

Lane: normalization

FlatPatch: initialize-tmpdir-before-process-startup

Form: GitDiff

Segment: none

Purpose: Ensure and publish a canonical temporary root before normal process startup creates worker threads.

Requires: none

Provides: Preserve a nonempty TMPDIR override, otherwise remove an empty override and select the standard-library host temporary root; create and canonicalize the selected directory, propagate errors, and publish TMPDIR.

Boundary: Home and harness selection, component-specific staging, and sandbox temporary-directory policy remain separate responsibilities.

Verification: arg0 tmpdir_selection tests and home-dir ensure_tmpdir_creates_selected_override verify missing and empty selection, explicit overrides, directory creation, and canonical paths.


